name: Pilot registration / Pilot-Registrierung
description: Register a voluntary real-release pilot without sharing private evidence.
title: "[Pilot] "
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        Thank you for testing CRA Release Evidence.

        This issue is public. Your public GitHub account, profile, and issue metadata
        are visible to GitHub and issue readers. Do **not** share source code, SBOM
        contents, findings, raw reports, internal filenames, hashes of internal
        files, credentials, customer information, or additional personal data.

        The action sends no telemetry. This issue is an optional, user-initiated
        registration stored by GitHub. It is not a legal or conformity assessment.

  - type: dropdown
    id: pilot_status
    attributes:
      label: Pilot status
      description: Only a package from an actual product release can qualify for the activation gate.
      options:
        - Not run yet
        - Run only for a test or demo tag
        - Run for an actual product release and package generated
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: dropdown
    id: segment
    attributes:
      label: Product segment
      options:
        - Installable commercial software
        - Commercial developer tool
        - Device firmware
        - Other product with digital elements
        - Pure SaaS
        - Not yet classified
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: dropdown
    id: repository_visibility
    attributes:
      label: Repository visibility
      options:
        - Public
        - Private
        - No repository used yet
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: action_version
    attributes:
      label: Action version
      description: Action tag or commit SHA only; do not provide internal file digests.
      placeholder: v0.1.0

  - type: checkboxes
    id: outputs
    attributes:
      label: Generated outputs
      description: Confirm presence only; do not paste content.
      options:
        - label: EVIDENCE.md was generated
        - label: evidence.json was generated
        - label: changes.json was generated
        - label: An SBOM was imported or a labelled manifest fallback was generated
        - label: Missing configured evidence was made visible when applicable

  - type: checkboxes
    id: inputs
    attributes:
      label: Input categories used
      options:
        - label: CycloneDX JSON or SPDX JSON
        - label: JUnit or comparable test output
        - label: SARIF
        - label: Trivy
        - label: Snyk
        - label: Another local report file
        - label: No externally generated reports

  - type: input
    id: public_evidence
    attributes:
      label: Optional public verification URL
      description: Only an already-public workflow run, release, or repository URL. Leave empty if disclosure could be sensitive.
      placeholder: https://github.com/...

  - type: textarea
    id: feedback
    attributes:
      label: What was useful or unclear?
      description: Describe setup and usability only; do not include findings, paths, or confidential product details.

  - type: dropdown
    id: follow_up
    attributes:
      label: May maintainers ask follow-up questions in this public issue?
      options:
        - "No"
        - "Yes"
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: checkboxes
    id: confirmations
    attributes:
      label: Confirmations
      options:
        - label: Any repository reported in this issue is not controlled by the CRA Release Evidence project team.
          required: true
        - label: I have not submitted confidential evidence or additional personal data beyond the public GitHub account, profile, and issue metadata described above.
          required: true
        - label: I understand that this tool does not make a legal or conformity assessment.
          required: true
